                "name": "PageDescription",
                "arguments": "{\"page_summary\": \"The page contains a section titled \\\"External links\\\" with a bulleted list of three external resources related to the Alps. The first bullet point references a 2005 satellite photo of the Alps from MODIS aboard Terra with a link to the NASA MODIS gallery. The second bullet point provides information about the Alpine Space Programme, an EU co-founded programme for co-finances transnational projects in the Alpine region, with a link to their official website. The third bullet point mentions an official forum about the Alps with a corresponding link. At the bottom of the page, there is a retrieval note indicating the content was retrieved from Wikipedia.\", \"keyfact\": \"The page provides three external links related to the Alps: a satellite photo from NASA MODIS, the Alpine Space Programme official website, and an official Alps forum.\"}"
              }
