e external links related to the Alps: a satellite photo from NASA MODIS, the Alpine Space Programme official website, and an official Alps forum.\"},\"name\":\"PageDescription\",\"type\":\"tool_use\"}]}}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"0271ccdd-c98c-483f-ab75-e09011fd4979\",\"created\":1793114441,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"us.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":\"tool_calls\",\"delta\":{}}],\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":1660,\"completion_tokens\":215,\"total_tokens\":1875,\"prompt_tokens_details\":{\"cached_tokens\":0,\"cache_write_tokens\":0},\"completion_tokens_details\":{\"reasoning_tokens\":0}},\"id\":\"0271ccdd-c98c-483f-ab75-e09011fd4979\",\"created\":1793114441,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"us.anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5-20251001-v1:0\"}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
